{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"可话还没出口，就怕自己的需要让对方觉得负担\",\"source\":\"像一个人准备对很亲近的人说一件已经想了很久的事，话还没出口，先有几秒钟沉默。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"原文是珠子里对人物状态的比喻，屏幕稿将尚未出口的话变成了人物当下真实准备说却没说的话，增加了定稿线中没有的具体行动。\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"可他已经听见时间正在经过\",\"source\":\"什么都还很好，可你已经听见时间正在经过。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文以第二人称描述听者的感受，屏幕稿改成他已经听见，把珠子里的听感转成了人物本人此刻的体验。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"因知道它珍贵而有了新重量\",\"source\":\"原来的温柔再次出现，却有了新的重量；而知道它有多珍贵以后，心里反而更容易发疼。\",\"type\":\"4\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文是知道它珍贵以后心里更容易发疼，屏幕稿却把这一原因接到了产生新重量上，改变了因果关系。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bbdef1a8-cca9-4586-b1a6-52bb5e660f63", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T070459600998Z", "elapsed_seconds": 333.985, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T07:10:33.596749+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "006afbfb2be2f428af1dff3c38d7ba4017403ddd5dbf94bef80da2b69811373a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fa